  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfriCereal Mechanized Farm Services Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice (post-harvest processing)..Beneficiaries: 10 employees (4 women); 1554 producers..Description: The project will enable AfriCereal to expand its threshing services to rice producers in the Malanville area, reducing post-harvest threshing losses by up to 50% and improving the quality of the paddy produces through reduced contamination with inseparable stones and other impurities, resulting in higher net incomes to producers.</narrative>
  </description>
